OL,3,GNEWSAThe driveway food shed that became
OL,4,Aa community hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small food shed set up on a driveway
OL,7,Fin Cheshire less than two years ago has
OL,8,Fgrown into a community hub which helps
OL,9,Fabout 200 people each week.
OL,11,FSutton Community Fridge was set up in
OL,12,FDecember 2024 by Gayle Parks to tackle
OL,13,Ffood waste and help families in the
OL,14,FMacclesfield area access affordable
OL,15,Ffood.
OL,17,FThe project collects surplus stock from
OL,18,Fsupermarkets, charities and businesses
OL,19,Fthat would otherwise be thrown away and
OL,20,Fmakes it available to buy at a low
OL,21,Fprice.
